kb/sources/martin-fowler-llm-voice.ingest.md:33:Commonplace is a working instance of the model-only documentation Fowler names as a speculation. The [landing page](../index.md) states the premise: LLM-written text can be useful even when no person reads it directly, because it can improve how an LLM answers your questions. The maintainer stated the same premise in the [Hacker News discussion of the essay](https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50301386), together with the gap-filling account that [LLM generation can hide a relaxed goal where human writing exposes a stall](../theory/llm-generation-relaxes-goals-where-human-writing-stalls.md) develops. Fowler's reception concern therefore applies to this KB's human-facing surfaces, not to its premise.
kb/sources/does-an-llm-keep-the-same-judgment-when-you-swap-the-answer.ingest.md:33:Connect found two kinds of fit. First, this thread is a strong **source-to-source compare-with** for [position-bias.ingest.md](./position-bias.ingest.md): the repo ingest remains the authoritative evidence substrate, while this thread is the compact public summary and motivation surface for the same benchmark family. Second, it can author lighter-weight `is-evidence-for` edges to the existing note cluster around pairwise judging and prompt-variation diagnostics: [Brainstorming: how to test whether pairwise comparison can harden soft oracles](../theory/brainstorming-how-to-test-whether-pairwise-comparison-can-harden.md) already lists position bias as a failure mode to measure; [Systematic prompt variation serves verification and diagnosis, not explanatory-reach testing](../theory/systematic-prompt-variation-serves-verification-and-diagnosis-not.md) treats order-swapping as a textbook diagnostic perturbation; and [Operational signals that a component is a relaxing candidate](../theory/operational-signals-that-a-component-is-a-relaxing-candidate.md) predicts exactly this kind of brittleness under reordering. Connect also flagged [Agent Skills for Context Engineering](../agent-memory-systems/reviews/agent-skills-for-context-engineering.md) as an evidentially strong but outbound-label-misaligned match: the review recommends order-swapping pairwise comparisons, and this thread is a concise public example of why.
kb/sources/amortized-reasoning-index.ingest.md:51:Persistence is reported across queries and batches in a task stream; persistence across independent sessions is envisioned rather than demonstrated here. Thus ARI is evidence for learning without the described loop qualifying as a theory builder. It does not challenge a definition that already separates those claims.
kb/sources/graphiti-temporal-knowledge-graph.ingest.md:35:Graphiti remains a concrete case for [temporal memory as a lifecycle capability](../theory/agent-memory-requirements/retire-redact-supersede-relax.md): validity and invalidation timestamps support current and point-in-time queries while retaining superseded facts. Across the [agent-memory systems comparison](../agent-memory-systems/agentic-memory-systems-comparative-review.md), that capability is one design axis among lineage, curation, activation, and verification; it is not evidence that graph storage determines those other properties.
kb/sources/conceptual-blending-humans-and-language-models.ingest.md:110:It compares with [LLM generation can hide a relaxed goal where human writing
kb/sources/conceptual-blending-humans-and-language-models.ingest.md:111:exposes a stall](../theory/llm-generation-relaxes-goals-where-human-writing-stalls.md)
kb/sources/conceptual-blending-humans-and-language-models.ingest.md:218:4. **Two rival signatures for unsatisfiable constraints** -- Lynn's "generic compromise" (all constraints thinly addressed) and the KB's relaxation note (one constraint silently dropped) predict observably different outputs. A small comparison on prompts with deliberately conflicting constraints could discriminate them. Both are unmeasured conjectures at present. [experiment]
kb/sources/conceptual-blending-humans-and-language-models.ingest.md:267:- [LLM generation can hide a relaxed goal where human writing exposes a stall](../theory/llm-generation-relaxes-goals-where-human-writing-stalls.md) — compares-with: rival conjectural mechanisms for LLM output under unsatisfiable constraints
kb/sources/i-reverse-engineered-instinct-s-memory-here-2101745550752428340.ingest.md:35:The contrast between explicit recall and implicit personalization is practitioner evidence relevant to [Knowledge storage does not imply contextual activation](../theory/knowledge-storage-does-not-imply-contextual-activation.md). It illustrates why recall and spontaneous use need separate assessment, without distinguishing failed retrieval from failed uptake of already visible information. Reported corrections, dated notes and Git history also provide a comparison with [Retire, Redact, Supersede, And Relax Memory](../theory/agent-memory-requirements/retire-redact-supersede-relax.md): changing a current record, expiring a fact and removing historical access are separate operations.
kb/sources/good-reminder-that-all-of-generative-ai-is-2115720125328634247.ingest.md:34:The thread is a public caution comparable to [LLM generation can hide a relaxed goal where human writing exposes a stall](../theory/llm-generation-relaxes-goals-where-human-writing-stalls.md). That note names a narrower possible defect: fluent prose can conceal an unmet constraint and leave the reader to rediscover it. Vendrov's perceived-quality warning motivates checking substance rather than accepting an impressive surface, but does not corroborate the note's conjectural relaxation mechanism. The existing note already provides the more specific KB-writing account; this source adds a compact statement of the broader concern, not a new established mechanism.
kb/sources/good-reminder-that-all-of-generative-ai-is-2115720125328634247.ingest.md:44:1. **A compact warning about acceptance signals.** The thread articulates why reader impressiveness should not substitute for checking whether KB prose meets its claims and constraints. This overlaps the existing hidden-goal-relaxation note and supplies no additional test or causal evidence. [just-a-reference]
kb/sources/good-reminder-that-all-of-generative-ai-is-2115720125328634247.ingest.md:49:The central training attribution groups pretraining, RLHF, and benchmark optimization without distinguishing their objectives or testing their effects. No model comparison, task population, measure of actual quality, or measure of human overestimation supports the near-universal claim. The adversarial framing therefore remains an interpretation, not evidence of intent or a demonstrated general causal mechanism. As the connected [hidden-goal-relaxation note](../theory/llm-generation-relaxes-goals-where-human-writing-stalls.md) also makes explicit, a plausible account of fluent failure does not establish its prevalence.
kb/sources/position-bias.ingest.md:73:Connect landed the source in the KB's judge-reliability / oracle-theory cluster; all ten outbound candidates are `is-evidence-for` edges into `kb/notes/`, because the source is empirical measurement rather than a new theoretical claim. Strongest attractor: [brainstorming-how-to-test-whether-pairwise-comparison-can-harden-soft-oracles](../theory/brainstorming-how-to-test-whether-pairwise-comparison-can-harden.md), which already lists "position bias rate" as one of its planned measures -- Mazur supplies both the metric operationalisation (decisive-pair flip rate) and an unmitigated baseline (44.8% median flip, 63.3% first-shown pick) the seedling was carrying as a placeholder. The source also has `is-evidence-for` edges to [systematic-prompt-variation-serves-verification-and-diagnosis](../theory/systematic-prompt-variation-serves-verification-and-diagnosis-not.md) (order-swap is a textbook diagnostic prompt variation: surface varied, task semantics preserved, invariance is the success criterion) and [operational-signals-that-a-component-is-a-relaxing-candidate](../theory/operational-signals-that-a-component-is-a-relaxing-candidate.md) (the first "relaxing" signal is "brittleness under paraphrase or reordering" -- Mazur measures exactly that, at the judge layer rather than the task-solver layer). Secondary `is-evidence-for` edges land at [error-correction-works-above-chance-oracles-with-decorrelated-checks](../theory/error-correction-works-above-chance-oracles-with-decorrelated-checks.md), [out-of-spec-output-is-a-failure-of-the-interpreter-not-the-spec](../theory/out-of-spec-output-is-a-failure-of-the-interpreter-not-the-spec.md), [reliability-dimensions-map-to-oracle-hardening-stages](../theory/reliability-dimensions-map-to-oracle-hardening-stages.md), [the-augmentation-automation-boundary-is-discrimination-not-accuracy](../theory/the-augmentation-automation-boundary-is-discrimination-not-accuracy.md), [oracle-strength-spectrum](../theory/oracle-strength-spectrum.md), [quality-signals-for-kb-evaluation](../theory/quality-signals-for-kb-evaluation.md), and [evaluation-automation-is-phase-gated-by-comprehension](../theory/evaluation-automation-is-phase-gated-by-comprehension.md). Source-to-source: the benchmark sits between [the Koylan pairwise ingest](./even-if-you-set-aside-whether-citations-are-the-right-proxy.ingest.md) (pairwise as a cleaner primitive) and [the Autoreason ingest](./autoreason-self-refinement-that-knows-when-to-stop.ingest.md) (blind-label Borda as a mitigation); it is the "unmitigated failure measurement" move between them. Connect also flagged an off-authorisation match with [agent-skills-for-context-engineering](../agent-memory-systems/reviews/agent-skills-for-context-engineering.md), which explicitly recommends order-swap mitigation; the correct route is a reverse edge from the review, not an outbound from here. Key insight for the graph: the source turns "LLM judges are noisy" from a hand-wave into a numeric prior and puts specific reverse-edge evidence within reach of seven seedling notes that currently cite only task-solver-layer evidence for equivalent claims.
kb/sources/position-bias.ingest.md:98:Write a new note in `kb/notes/` titled approximately "Pairwise LLM judges flip ~45% of the time under order swap on sibling-edit pairs". It should (a) state the median-44.8% flip and 63.3% first-shown pick as numeric priors, citing this ingest report as `evidenced-by`; (b) connect laterally to [brainstorming-how-to-test-whether-pairwise-comparison-can-harden-soft-oracles](../theory/brainstorming-how-to-test-whether-pairwise-comparison-can-harden.md) (whose placeholder "position bias rate" measure this benchmark grounds) and to [operational-signals-that-a-component-is-a-relaxing-candidate](../theory/operational-signals-that-a-component-is-a-relaxing-candidate.md) as judge-layer evidence for brittleness-under-reordering; (c) codify the operational rule that any single-view LLM-as-judge eval must be treated as order-contaminated unless it randomises order, aggregates both swapped views, or demonstrates sub-10% flip on a sibling-pair probe set. After the note lands, author the seven reverse-edge `evidenced-by` links connect identified (strongest first: brainstorming, operational-signals, out-of-spec-output, reliability-dimensions) so the snapshot is reachable from the existing seedling cluster.
kb/sources/dreaming-with-a-dynamic-workflow-cookbook.ingest.md:37:Three mechanisms supply concrete cases for existing theory. The parallel-analyzer and single-organizer split is evidence for [coordination guarantees, not just coordination channels](../theory/agent-orchestration-needs-coordination-guarantees-not-just.md). Its guarantee against inconsistency is explicit: re-read before editing, make only targeted index edits, read back after every write, link rather than merge during the parallel phase, and defer every merge and rename to a phase in which no other agent writes. The lifecycle operations are evidence for [retire, redact, supersede, and relax memory](../theory/agent-memory-requirements/retire-redact-supersede-relax.md): dated supersession, `CONFLICT:` marking when the later correction is unclear, `MOVED TO` retirement stubs, and version redaction for leaked secrets. The injection posture is evidence for [one-medium interpretation of instructions and content](../theory/llm-context-interprets-instructions-and-content-through-one-medium.md): it enforces the role boundary architecturally rather than by prompt alone, and it names the residual risk when `_index.md` is loaded into a session's `instructions`.
kb/sources/the-anatomy-of-an-agent-harness-2031408954517971368.ingest.md:41:- [codification-and-relaxing-navigate-the-bitter-lesson-boundary](../theory/codification-and-relaxing-navigate-the-bitter-lesson-boundary.md) — **exemplifies**: the model/harness co-training feedback loop is codify/relax operating at the training boundary
kb/sources/the-anatomy-of-an-agent-harness-2031408954517971368.ingest.md:78:2. **No engagement with what harness components should be *removed*.** The post is entirely additive — each section adds a component. But the [Voooooogel "What Survives" source](voooooogel-multi-agent-future.ingest.md) argues that many harness components are vision features that stronger models will dissolve. The post acknowledges this in one sentence ("some of what lives in the harness today will get absorbed into the model") but doesn't identify *which* components are candidates for absorption. The [codification-and-relaxing](../theory/codification-and-relaxing-navigate-the-bitter-lesson-boundary.md) framework provides the analytical tool (arithmetic regime components survive, vision-feature components relax), but this source doesn't use it or anything equivalent.
kb/sources/the-anatomy-of-an-agent-harness-2031408954517971368.ingest.md:88:Write a note titled "Practitioner harness taxonomy converges on KB theoretical framework" connecting to [methodology-enforcement-is-constraining](../theory/methodology-enforcement-is-constraining.md), [codification-and-relaxing-navigate-the-bitter-lesson-boundary](../theory/codification-and-relaxing-navigate-the-bitter-lesson-boundary.md), and [context-efficiency-is-the-central-design-concern-in-agent-systems](../theory/context-efficiency-is-the-central-design-concern-in-agent-systems.md) — it would argue that three independent sources (Vtrivedy10's component taxonomy, Lopopolo's practitioner report, the cybernetics thread) describe the same phenomena the KB's theoretical notes name (constraining, codify/relax, context efficiency, deploy-time learning), and that this convergence from practice onto theory is evidence the framework captures something real. The note would include a mapping table: harness component -> model limitation it addresses -> KB concept it instantiates. This fills the synthesis opportunity flagged by `/connect`: the KB has the theories and the practitioner evidence, but no note yet explicitly maps between them.
